  dose change > 0 on 25 of 25; lower-edge scale change > 0 on 25 of 25; exact 'none' weights give 1.000 on 25 of 25.
  Coverage under the strong shift with exact strong weights is at least 0.89 on 21 of 25 seeds (W1; standard: case 2).
  four-learner cql     medium        : dose standard [1.347, 1.352, 1.373, 1.352, 1.361] -> IW [1.494, 1.493, 1.496, 1.494, 1.497]; change [0.144, 0.147, 0.138, 0.149, 0.128]
